# Updates Index — Skill Evolution Update Manifests

Registry of /sdd-evolve Update Manifests (machine-readable audit
trail, skills/evolution.sdd). Entry: UPD-<date>-<n> @updates/<file>.

Rules:
  [UPDX-01] Every /sdd-evolve run produces exactly one manifest.
  [UPDX-02] Manifest records trigger, counts, changes, sources,
            validation, and delivery — [EVO-06].
  [UPDX-03] Manifests are append-only history ([R57]).

State: +
